Source: mdnsd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Alex <alex@mapleprecision.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.88), rustc (>= 1.88)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mdnsd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: mDNS discovery and per-segment reflection daemon
 mdnsd discovers mDNS devices and reflects them between network segments,
 and can track devices for scripts. mdnsctl is the client for its control
 socket.
 .
 No configuration is installed: the service does not start until
 /etc/mdnsd.conf exists.
